    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to use your strength to batter an opponent to the ground, knocking him or her <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bantha_Rush\" title=\"Bantha Rush\">Bantha Rush</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trip\" title=\"Trip\">Trip</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you successfully move a creature with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bantha_Rush\" title=\"Bantha Rush\">Bantha Rush</a> Feat, you also knock that target <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prone\">Prone</a>.</p>",
